{"guide":{"questionsToConsider":["What does your complaints process promise, and does the ending describe the next step accurately?","Which complaint topics go to which team or manager?","Who is told straight away when someone reports a safety risk?","Do you need to keep complaints for a set period, and who can see them?"],"howToUseResponses":"Read safety reports as they arrive and act on them first. For everything else, acknowledge each complaint, give it one owner and keep the person's account separate from your findings. Look at the requested outcomes next to the topics every quarter: a run of refund requests about deliveries points to a different fix than a run of apologies about staff.","customizeSteps":["Edit the topic options so each one maps to a team that can investigate it.","Rewrite both endings to state your real next step, such as when to expect a first reply, without promising a timeline you can't keep.","Link the form from your contact page, receipts and help pages, and say plainly that complaints are welcome."],"faqs":[{"q":"What should a complaint form include?","a":"Contact details, what happened and when, any reference number, how it affected the person and what they want done. A place for evidence helps, but it should be optional."},{"q":"Should a complaint form require evidence?","a":"No. Ask for it, but let people complain without it. Many people have no receipt or photo, and their account is still worth investigating."},{"q":"How should I respond to a complaint?","a":"Acknowledge it quickly, tell the person who is looking into it and give them a realistic time for a full answer. Then reply to the outcome they asked for, even if the answer is no."},{"q":"Can people complain anonymously with this form?","a":"As written it asks for a name and email so you can reply. You can make those questions optional if you want to accept anonymous reports, but you won't be able to follow up."}]},"doc":{"schemaVersion":10,"title":"Complaint form","description":"Record what happened, its impact and the outcome the person wants, in their own words.","blocks":[{"id":"blk_complain00","ref":"welcome","title":"We're sorry something went wrong. Tell us what happened and we'll look into it properly.","required":false,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"buttonLabel":"Start","type":"welcome"},{"id":"blk_complain01","ref":"contact","title":"Your name and email, so we can reply","description":"We use these only to respond to your complaint.","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"contact_info","fields":["first_name","last_name","email"]},{"id":"blk_complain02","ref":"about","title":"What is your complaint about?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"single_select","options":[{"id":"opt_a_product","label":"A product","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_a_service_or","label":"A service or appointment","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_how_a_member","label":"How a member of staff treated me","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_a_delivery","label":"A delivery","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_a_charge_or","label":"A charge or bill","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_something_else","label":"Something else","image_key":null}],"allowOther":false},{"id":"blk_complain03","ref":"happened_on","title":"When did it happen?","description":"If you're not sure of the exact day, your best guess is fine.","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"date","disablePast":false,"dateFormat":"YYYY-MM-DD","includeTime":false,"timeStepMinutes":30,"timeMin":"09:00","timeMax":"18:00"},{"id":"blk_complain04","ref":"reference","title":"Any order, booking or account number we should look up?","required":false,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"short_text","unique":false,"minLength":0,"maxLength":80},{"id":"blk_complain05","ref":"what_happened","title":"What happened? Include names, places and times if you have them.","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"long_text","minLength":0,"maxLength":4000,"aiQualityCheck":false},{"id":"blk_complain06","ref":"seriousness","title":"How serious was it?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"single_select","options":[{"id":"opt_someone_s_health","label":"Someone's health or safety was put at risk","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_it_cost_me","label":"It cost me money or a lot of time","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_it_was_upsetting","label":"It was upsetting or unfair","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_it_was_frustrating","label":"It was frustrating but minor","image_key":null}],"allowOther":false},{"id":"blk_complain07","ref":"safety_detail","title":"Is anyone still at risk? Tell us what we need to know to act on it now.","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"long_text","minLength":0,"maxLength":2000,"aiQualityCheck":false},{"id":"blk_complain08","ref":"evidence","title":"Photos, receipts or emails that support your complaint","description":"Optional. If you don't have any, your account of it is enough.","required":false,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"file_upload","accept":["image/*","application/pdf"],"maxFiles":5,"maxSizeMB":10},{"id":"blk_complain09","ref":"raised_before","title":"Have you already raised this with us?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"yes_no","yesLabel":"Yes","noLabel":"No"},{"id":"blk_complain10","ref":"previous_contact","title":"Who did you speak to, and what were you told?","required":false,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"long_text","minLength":0,"maxLength":1000,"aiQualityCheck":false},{"id":"blk_complain11","ref":"resolution","title":"What would you like us to do?","required":true,"visibilit